SharedLvmThin for Proxmox VE
============================

Components
----------

SharedLvmThinPlugin.pm
    Proxmox VE shared LVM thin storage backend.

pve-sharedlvmthin-monitor
    dmeventd thin-pool monitoring and cluster-safe autogrow helper.

sharedlvmthin
    Health, compatibility and deep validation CLI.

sharedlvmthin-health-json
    Read-only machine-readable health collector.

sharedlvmthin-web
    Optional read-only HTTPS health dashboard.

sharedlvmthin-web-configure
    Interactive dashboard network, TLS and access configuration.


Health Check
------------

    sharedlvmthin doctor


Deep Validation
---------------

Deep validation performs temporary write operations and must only be
started explicitly by an administrator from the CLI.

    sharedlvmthin doctor --deep

Deep validation is intentionally not exposed as a web action.


Web Dashboard
-------------

Configure or reconfigure:

    sharedlvmthin-web-configure

The dashboard:

- uses HTTPS
- binds only to the selected host IP
- delegates authentication to Proxmox VE
- does not store PVE passwords
- requires an authenticated administrator
- exposes health information read-only
- does not expose storage write operations

The storage plugin does not depend on the web dashboard. Failure or
disablement of the web service does not affect the storage data path.
